description	"Sith Forcemaster

Dark Side masters who forego the use of a Lightsaber in favor of martial arts and Force proficiency.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Martial Arts (Dual Saber)
-- Saber Defense (0)
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- No Blaster Block
-- 75% more knockback
-- 60% more special damage
-- 40% shorter
-- 166% thicker

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Sense (3)
- Lightning (1) ^3[CS4]
- Drain (2)
- Grip (1) ^3[CS3]
- Repulse ^3[Melee CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Fury (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
- Aerial Force Regen
- Sense Immunity
- Force Block/Focus (3)

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]"